WEBVTT

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.630
At last, the decennial combat festival known as the

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:13.880
"Grand Fighting Tournament" has
reached its exciting conclusion!

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:18.610
Could a Human bring home the gold
for the first time in 150 years!?

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.220
If I win this thing now...

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.730
We... Luvellia-senpai and I...

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.850
Somewhere out there, in a faraway land...

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:46.650
A martial arts competition to decide the strongest
man on the planet was underway.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:55.360
To the victor of said competition goes fame and glory.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:59.540
In turn, he will become the object of international intrigue.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.020
Your new champion is...

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:13.300
The representative of the Yakeppachi Warriors Guild:

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.750
Peter Grill!

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:15.750
Indeed.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.810
Peter Grill knew not of what the future had in store...

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.980
Nor the terror that lay ahead...

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:34.990
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:41.040
Dug myself into a hole with no way out

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.540
Back against the wall...

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.380
I mean, how could I resist?

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.090
"This wasn't supposed to happen,"

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.670
I keep denying

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.130
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.300
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:53.800
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.760
I can't stand myself

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.180
Moping around, spouting lies, grieving a broken heart

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.140
I hold on desperately to these feelings and shut my eyes

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.610
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.610
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:10.230
I suffocate under its weight

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.150
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.570
Always discouraged by my weaknesses,

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.790
I drop to my knees and grovel at your feet,

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.790
clinging selfishly to the hope for forgiveness

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.130
Dug myself into a hole with no way out...

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.380
Full of regret and powerless to change,

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:33.630
I feel my heart being torn apart

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:37.390
on this night of endless shame and despair

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.600
Why can't I get my act together?

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.730
Got nothing but this pathetic self of mine...

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:58.660
Episode

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:58.660
Peter Grill and the Ogre Sisters

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.250
Yo, Peter!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.740
What happened to meetin' up at the bar!?

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:05.310
Gotta hurry...

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.090
I can't wait to celebrate with her...!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.000
Senpai...

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:10.450
Senpai!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.020
Oh, it's you, Mimi.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.070
Major congrats on your win!

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:17.420
As a fellow guild member, I couldn't be more proud!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:21.430
Huh, looks like I'm the first one to show up...

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.360
Hm? What do you mean?

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.540
Well, y'see...

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.140
Now that you're officially the strongest man on the planet,

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.980
I've got a favor to ask...

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.120
Not sure what you're gettin' at...

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.470
But since I'm in a good mood, go ahead and lay it on me!

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.860
Aw, thanks! Much appreciation!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.070
So, I was thinking...

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:40.820
Hm...?

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.710
Lemme get your junk spunk!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:47.720
Are you crazy!? What are you talking about!?

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.800
Oopsie... Did I say something I wasn't supposed to...?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.840
For us Ogres, producing strong
offspring is a pretty big deal...

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.250
And in terms of breeding partners, a champion like you...

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:02.250
Ogre-based logic isn't gonna fly around here!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.840
I'm sorry!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.400
I forgot the Human Realm has rules for this sorta stuff...

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.590
Jeez...

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:12.020
Y'see, it hasn't been very long since I moved here...

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.020
She's not a bad kid.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.790
But the weirdest crap comes flyin'
outta her mouth sometimes...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.260
'Kay! I understand now, Senpai!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.490
Would you...

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.520
Please consider having sex with me!?

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.520
You obviously don't understand a damn thing!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.530
Enough of your foolishness!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.880
B-Big Sis!?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:29.900
Oh, Lisa!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.420
Talk some sense into her, would you!?

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.550
Mimi, I insist you cease this behavior immediately.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.510
For I shall be the one to partake in this man's loins!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.510
You, too...!?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.750
A close call, indeed.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.860
At this precise moment,

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.020
countless nations are beginning
the race to obtain your sperm.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:53.670
As an Ogre of the fairer sex,
I cannot allow such a thing to happen!

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.910
History has proven time and again...

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.960
The blood of the most powerful
warriors belongs to ogres!

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:00.990
Unbelievable...

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:03.330
Come along, Peter Grill...

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:06.530
You get the picture, so no puttin' up a fight!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.410
Seriously!?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.710
This can't be happening!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.600
Huh?

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:17.420
What is it?

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.420
What?

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.590
I refuse to be your studhorse!

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.460
Peter Grill!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:29.480
On my pride as an Ogre...
I shall <i>never</i> let you slip through my grasp!

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.610
Yeah!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:35.020
Forget them... There's no time to waste, Peter!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.820
Go... Quickly!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.250
Take your place by her side...!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.090
Luvellia-senpai!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.780
Hello, Peter-kun.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.920
I've been waiting for you.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.060
I finally did it.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.650
And now... Now we're home free!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:57.110
Indeed... he may be stubborn,

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.860
but with such an impressive victory under your belt,

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.960
my father <i>has</i> to give us his blessing.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.090
Once we're married...

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.930
All that's left is to have a child
and carry on the family name.

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:11.210
Uh... Just checking, but...

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:14.320
Could you remind me how babies are made?

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.060
Not this again...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.950
Despite what you think, I'm not <i>completely</i> oblivious.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:22.940
Pay attention.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:24.950
I won't spare you the details.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.060
When two people who love
each other pray to the heavens,

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.830
the stork carries their child to a cabbage patch.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.730
It's the miracle of life!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.330
So innocent...!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.340
I can't help but feel that's the <i>real</i> miracle...

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.350
It's been two years since Senpai and I started dating.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:48.520
Thanks to the Guildmaster's overprotective
personality and brainwashing methods,

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.350
all we've done is hold hands!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.350
If we get married like this, I'm screwed...

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:56.950
Come on!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.360
Why don't we say a prayer together, Peter-kun?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.860
Sure...

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.620
What a day...

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.530
I'm glad I won the tournament,
but now I've got all sorts of problems...

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:18.040
Goof juice...!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.460
There's no use dwelling on it...

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.600
Ta-da! Guess who!?

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:33.670
Make a woman outta me, Senpai!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.520
Go away!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:42.520
Wait, Senpai! Please open the door! C'mon, Senpai!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.520
Have these Ogres no sense of decency!?

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.200
It seems the two of us are finally alone...

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:51.820
Open up, Peter Grill!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.800
What <i>exactly</i> are you dissatisfied with!?

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:54.920
Is this about money!?

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.660
How much do we gotta pay!?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.580
Shut up and take a hike!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.250
What's all the ruckus...?

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.990
No way...

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.920
This dude's kickin' out a couple of naked girls...

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.750
Seriously!?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.670
What an asshole...

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.050
Goddammit!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.670
Breathe..

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.370
At this rate, you're gonna fall into their trap...

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.270
I'm happily engaged to Luvellia-senpai...

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.850
We are well aware, Peter Grill,
of the fact that your relationship with Luvellia...

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.070
...has never gone beyond holding hands, for example...

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.530
Us, on the other hand...

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.340
H-Hold on...

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:38.790
We can entertain you in ways she
couldn't even begin to imagine...

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.000
Knock it off!

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.460
What kind of scumbag do you take me for!?

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.730
Senpai and I made a commitment to one another!

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.010
Betraying her trust...

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.970
It's absolutely unforgivable!

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:54.440
That's right...

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:59.180
And no Ogre on this planet can convince me otherwise!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:06.250
Did you... say something just now?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.720
C-Crap... This feeling...

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.730
There's someone I care about deeply...!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.930
And yet...

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.620
I...

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.970
I...

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.090
What have I done!?

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.240
How could I be so weak...!?

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.300
Why...

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.160
Why...!?

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:43.550
Why couldn't I keep it in my pants!?

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:48.380
Peter-kun, are you awake?

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.630
I know that voice...!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.060
Oh no...

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.180
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.230
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.860
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:12.110
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.190
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.860
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.080
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.500
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.460
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.830
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.550
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.010
That's good enough for me

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:37.180
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:41.050
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.470
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.560
And find no one like you

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:48.560
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:52.520
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.740
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.780
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.030
{Preview}

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.910
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.680
Word on the street is you won the tournament
and got engaged to Luvellia-san.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:10.050
Episode

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:10.050
Peter Grill and the Future Father-in-Law

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.520
Betcha feel like the luckiest guy alive right now, eh?
